@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Unknown API
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Search, price and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices?q=DEMO&minPrice=100000&maxPrice=300000&page=1&limit=5&sort=price_asc

### Configuration filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices?spec.RAM=16%20GB&spec.CPU=i5

### Search any configuration value
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices?configuration=Full%20HD

### Register renter (use your own password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Test Renter","email":"renter@example.com","password":"ReplaceWithYourPassword123"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"renter@example.com","password":"ReplaceWithYourPassword123"}

### Current account (paste accessToken below)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Admin creates staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Staff User","email":"staff@example.com","password":"ReplaceWithYourPassword123","role":"staff"}
